M291 S4 K{"Automatic (T0+T1 avg)","Manual (Pyrometer)","Cancel"} R"Calibration Method" P"Select calibration reference method:<br><br>Automatic: Uses average of tool temperatures<br>Manual: You measure with pyrometer/thermocouple"

